guide nood/05-12-25
title 12-25 Nood: RFC, Ruins of Lordaeron, WC, SFK, BFD
levels 12-25
zone map 1454
faction Horde
folder Nood Guide
why Dungeon-focused leveling. When you reach a dungeon's level you run it first, then do only the most efficient zone quests until the next dungeon. 12-25: Thrall's 'Hidden Enemies' at 12 -> (Barrens if not 13 yet) -> Ragefire Chasm…
coords era
next nood/06-25-30
# Written by tools/emit_guide.py from 05_12-25_BalCon.lua (BalCon 1.2.2). Edit the converter, not this file.

step
  only Tauren
  tip Follow the road north out of Mulgore to the Crossroads in the Barrens, discover the flight path, then run up the main road north to Orgrimmar.
  zone map 1413
  getfp "Crossroads"

step
  only Skyborne
  tip Coming down southeast from Thunder Bluff, discover the Camp Taurajo flight path.
  zone map 1413
  note "If you ended the 1-12 guide early at level 12: take the skyship from the dock west of Valanaar to Thunder Bluff, then follow the steps below."
  getfp "Camp Taurajo"

step
  only Skyborne
  tip From Thunder Bluff head southeast, follow the main road to the Crossroads, then run up the main road north to Orgrimmar.
  zone map 1413
  getfp "Crossroads"

step
  only Undead
  tip Take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar from the tower east of Undercity.
  zone map 1420
  goto 60.7,58.8 r 20 map 1420

step
  tip Discover the Orgrimmar flight path (skipped automatically if you already have it).
  zone map 1454
  note "This guide starts at level 12. First, go to Thrall in Orgrimmar for the Ragefire Chasm prerequisite \"Hidden Enemies\"."
  note "*Spells*: this note means you can train new spells."
  note "Save gold for your level 40 mount, though — only train the important spells."
  note "== Joining from your starting zone =="
  note "If you finished the 1-12 guide: follow the main road north from Razor Hill to Orgrimmar." only Orc,Troll
  getfp "Orgrimmar"

